# 升级暂存区：仅在升级时由用户临时填充，不入仓库
.upgrade/*
!.upgrade/README.md

# teammate 的"已启动"标记：每个 spawn/reactivate prompt 第 0 步写入；属运行时状态，不入仓库。
*_team/teammates/*/.started

# 其他运行期文件：hook 日志、idle hook 的计数器、每次写入都会重写的注册表备份（git 已保留历史），
# 以及写入中断时可能留下的临时文件。守则备份（*.rules.bak.*、*.teammate_rules.bak.*）
# 保持纳入管理：其中可能有用户内容。
.hook_logs/
*_team/teammates/*/.checkpoint_nudge_count
*_team/TEAMMATE_INFO.json.bak
*_team/.info.??????
*_team/.policy.??????
# /remote-collab 的运行时状态：每次查看、合并、推送都会变，入 git 只会制造提交和冲突。
*_team/.remote_collab_state
*/.remote_collab_state
*_team/teammates/*/remote_seen
*_team/teammates/*/digests/
*_team/teammates/*/loop_job
*_team/.remote_seen
*/.remote_seen
*_team/.remote_collab_watch.pid
*/.remote_collab_watch.pid
*_team/digests/
*/digests/
*/.rc.??????
**/.README.md.??????
# 改写 VERSION 或 settings.conf 时被中断而留下的临时文件。
/.VERSION.??????
/settings.conf.??????
